WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.403
-Welcome back. We are hanging
out with the talented Gal Gadot.

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:04.937
Now, last time
you were on our show,

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:08.041
you tried a Reese's Peanut
Butter Cup for the first time.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.810
-Right, and it was
a very nice experience.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.578
-I'm happy that that happened.

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:14.948
You also brought me
an Israeli snack.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.083
-Because I love you so much.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.785
-Thank you,
and the love is mutual.

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:21.955
Today I thought we could take
turns trying some more foods

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.689
that we haven't had before.

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:24.991
Does that sound good?

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:27.126
-I don't know. Let's see.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.928
-I know. I don't even want to
look at what I'm having.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.496
But alright.
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:33.732
-I got yours. So you have stuff
that you've never had before.

00:00:33.732 --> 00:00:35.334
And this is the first time
you're trying this.

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:38.704
So, this is a holiday classic
that I personally love

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:39.705
that you've never had before.

00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:41.674 line:0%
It's called egg nog. Okay.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.276 line:0%
-Is it safe to drink?

00:00:44.276 --> 00:00:45.511 line:0%
-Of course it's safe.

00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:46.980 line:0%
-Is it with alcohol?

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.515 line:0%
-Normally, you put rum in it,
but don't have to.

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:51.251 line:0%
You can have it nonalcoholic.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.420 line:0%
It's like -- you know, nog was
a thing -- a holiday thing.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.389 line:0%
It's almost like a --
it's very festive,

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.891 line:0%
a little cinnamon in there.
-Okay.

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:01.094 line:0%
-Yeah, I think it's --
-But the egg is cooked?

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:03.563 line:0%
Like, it's okay?
It's been pasteurized, right?

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.097 line:0%
-No, I don't think
the egg is cooked.

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:08.067 line:0%
There's no -- You won't get
clumps of egg in there.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:11.637 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]
-It's just called egg nog.

00:01:11.637 --> 00:01:14.273 line:0%
I honestly don't even know if
what you're drinking has egg.

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:16.075 line:0%
-Oh, there's no eggs in this?

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:18.010 line:0%
-It's all chemicals,
chemical eggs.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.380 line:0%
-[ Laughs ] Oh, great.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.781 line:0%
-Take a sip.
Let's see what happens.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.383 line:0%
Egg nog for the first time.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:29.455 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.791 line:0%
You looked at me like I did
something bad to you.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.527 line:0%
-No, it's -- it's --
it's just --

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:37.262 line:0%
I don't want to hurt
the people's feelings.

00:01:37.262 --> 00:01:38.798 line:0%
-Oh, it's not the people.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.333 line:0%
There is no people
behind egg nog.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.734 line:0%
-The company.
-Trust me, the world --

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.135 line:0%
There is no company.

00:01:43.135 --> 00:01:47.673 line:0%
-Maybe with rum it's better,
but it's just very, uh...

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:49.909 line:0%
-Thick?
-Thick, yeah.

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.677 line:0%
-Alright, so you say
it was almost like pudding,

00:01:51.677 --> 00:01:53.512 line:0%
maybe or something
or what is it like?

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:59.651
-It's like pudding, but it's
more liquid than pudding,

00:01:59.651 --> 00:02:01.654
but it's still like...

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.988
-Okay, alright,
so not your favorite.

00:02:02.988 --> 00:02:04.490
Not your favorite.
Alright, great.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:07.626
Now, you have a food for me.

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:09.662
-Yes, the first one is --

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:13.866
You see, this is how much
I like you.

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:16.836 line:0%
Because I bring you
sufganiyot for Hanukkah.

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:19.005 line:0%
-Uh-huh.
-And this is basically dough,

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:21.907 line:0%
