00:02:21.907 --> 00:02:23.809 line:0%
-What is it called again?

00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:26.445 line:0%
-Sufganiyot.
-Soukinnia?

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:29.215 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]
Bless you. Sufganiyot.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:30.816 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:33.753 line:0%
-It comes in threes --
sou fing ya.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.622 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]
"Sou fing ya!"

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:36.923 line:0%
-I got one more. I got one more.

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:38.424 line:0%
Come on.
It's coming. It's coming.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.959 line:0%
Sou fing ya.
Alright, here we go.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.762 line:0%
Alright, so I'm just gonna go --
it's like a jelly doughnut?

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:44.797 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:48.133 line:0%
It's the best when it's fresh
out of the oil.

00:02:48.133 --> 00:02:49.401 line:0%
But it's delicious, right?

00:02:49.401 --> 00:02:53.039 line:0%
I mean, pure goodness.

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:55.675 line:0%
-Un-un-unbelievable.
That is delicious.

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.777 line:0%
That's one of the best jelly
doughnuts I've ever had.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:59.578 line:0%
I'll have another bite.
I loved it.

00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:01.547 line:0%
-Yeah, go for it.

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:03.249 line:0%
You see the jelly? Ah!

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:06.251 line:0%
-Come on.
-Now I'm jealous.

00:03:06.251 --> 00:03:08.454
-I have more surprises for you.

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:11.056
-I know, but I'm not looking
forward to them.

00:03:11.056 --> 00:03:13.092
-No, no, these are all good.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:15.662
-Next up, you've got
a classic American snack.

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:17.096
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:19.165 line:0%
-This is Ho-Hos.

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.633 line:0%
-Okay, this is the chocolate,
