00:03:21.633 --> 00:03:23.770 line:0%
-Yes.
-I like chocolate.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.905 line:0%
-Yeah, of course.
So, these are Ho-Hos.

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:27.774 line:0%
And you've never had
a Ho-Ho before,

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:31.777 line:0%
