00:04:31.236 --> 00:04:33.405 line:0%
-Yeah.
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:33.405 --> 00:04:35.341 line:0%
-Probably --
yeah, hopefully, yeah.

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.244 line:0%
