00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.217 line:0%
That was a win!

00:04:45.217 --> 00:04:46.785 line:0%
Oh, I'll take that!

00:04:46.785 --> 00:04:48.153 line:0%
Yes!

00:04:48.153 --> 00:04:49.889 line:0%
-This is the best so far.

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:51.024 line:0%
-I love that too.

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:52.825 line:0%
-Flavorful.
-Right?

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:54.493 line:0%
