00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:05.505 line:0%
I'd never do that to you.
-That was really good.

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:08.073 line:0%
-Oh, I love that you did this.
-I'm going to have another bite.

00:05:08.073 --> 00:05:10.742
-Oh, my God, I love this.

00:05:10.742 --> 00:05:12.845
